id=astra
name=Astra governor
version=0.3
versionCode=3
author=aurokin
description=Frame-rate governor for the RedMagic Astra (NP05J). In Game Space games outside Diablo it holds each game's own frame rate with the lowest CPU and GPU clock minimums that keep it on time; outside games it keeps video from dropping frames. Disable or remove this module to return to stock behaviour.
